# About the project button — frosted glass

Case-detail **About the project** control uses an **Apple globalnav–style** frosted shell plus the site hover glare wipe.

## Visual recipe

1. Shell (`GlareHover.project-case-demo__toggle-glare`): `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72)`, `backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px)`, no heavy border / liquid `::after` / inset glare.
2. Label: solid `#1d1d1f` — **no** `mix-blend-mode: difference`, **no** contrast overlay span. Child fill stays transparent so the wipe is visible.
3. Rounded rectangle (`8px`) — not a capsule; keep padding / Medium weight.
4. Hover wipe uses `GLARE_WIPE_MS` from `GlareHover.tsx`.

## Keep (do not rip out)

- Sticky pin in the case body
- ClickSpark
- Open / close (`is-open`, panel push)
- Panel push / mobile sheet behavior

## Do not

- Bring back the + / × icon or rotate animation
- Bring back liquid-glass `::after`, difference-blend contrast layers, or luminance `is-on-light` swaps
- Replace with the full adaptive-glass-button markup
